franchise=(('<section class="franchise-film" aria-label="Nanolite franchise film"><video class="franchise-video" src="assets/media/franchise.mp4" poster="assets/media/franchise-poster.jpg" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" disablepictureinpicture disableremoteplayback></video></section>') if (R/'assets/media/franchise.mp4').is_file() else '')+intro('Manufacturing / Partnership','Franchise With Us','Your market. Your manufacturing journey. Nanolite by your side.')+'<section class="wrap section franchise-intro"><p class="eyebrow">A partnership built around production</p><h2>Turn your next chapter<br>into a manufacturing operation.</h2><p>Explore cellular lightweight concrete production with Nanolite. Our team works with you on equipment selection, factory planning, production requirements and implementation.</p>'+button('Discuss your plans','contact.html?topic=Franchise%20partnership#inquiry')+'</section><section class="wrap franchise-benefits"><article><p class="eyebrow">01 / Planning</p><h2>Your site. Your system.</h2><p>Review your available factory space, utilities, production objectives and target products with our engineering team.</p></article><article><p class="eyebrow">02 / Production</p><h2>A line that fits.</h2><p>Select a T-series configuration and discuss material storage, batching, mixing, moulds and handling requirements.</p></article><article><p class="eyebrow">03 / Support</p><h2>From setup to operation.</h2><p>Confirm commissioning, operator training, production guidance and after-sales assistance in your project proposal.</p></article></section><section class="wrap section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Find your production system.</h2><p>Explore equipment configurations with our team. Nominal daily outputs are shown below. Actual output depends on block dimensions, mix, shift length, curing and handling. Investment is quoted for your agreed configuration.</p></div><div class="franchise-plants">'+''.join(row(id) for id in PLANTS)+'</div></section><section class="franchise-process"><div class="wrap"><h2>From first conversation<br>to your factory floor.</h2><ol><li><h3>Share your requirements</h3><p>Tell us your location, target products, available site and intended start date.</p></li><li><h3>Review your proposal</h3><p>Discuss equipment, layout, utilities, commercial terms and the proposed scope of support.</p></li><li><h3>Prepare your site</h3><p>Coordinate civil works, electricity, water, material storage and production workflow.</p></li><li><h3>Commission and train</h3><p>Agree the installation process, trial production, operator training and ongoing assistance.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class="wrap section franchise-faq"><h2>Planning your partnership</h2><details><summary>What information should I prepare?</summary><p>Share your project location, factory area, utility availability, target products, expected output and intended start date.</p></details><details><summary>How is investment determined?</summary><p>The team prepares a quotation for your agreed equipment and support scope. Site works, utilities, transport, taxes and working capital should be discussed separately.</p></details><details><summary>Can the system grow with my operation?</summary><p>Discuss your expansion goals during planning so that the proposed layout and configuration can be reviewed against future requirements.</p></details><details><summary>What support is included?</summary><p>Installation, commissioning, training and service terms are confirmed in the quotation and partnership documentation.</p></details></section><section class="franchise-contact"><div class="wrap"><h2>Let’s plan your next operation.</h2><p>Tell us where you want to build and what you want to produce.</p>'+button('Talk to our team','contact.html?topic=Franchise%20partnership#inquiry')+'</div></section>'
